    {
      "id": 7,
      "name": "Overtime Tax (Junior)",
      "code": "overtime_junior",
      "description": "Final tax on overtime for junior employees whose year-to-date income is GH₵18,000 or less: 5% on the first 50% of monthly basic salary and 10% on the portion above. Once year-to-date income exceeds the threshold, overtime is taxed at the normal graduated PAYE rates going forward. Per Ghana's Income Tax Act, 2015 (Act 896).",
